Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.85,0:02:01.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.25,0:02:07.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会履行义务的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.65,0:02:11.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第 10 话 同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.95,0:02:37.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半井你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.65,0:02:50.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.35,0:02:59.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想打我们?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.85,0:03:04.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快打扫卫生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.35,0:03:11.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她让我们快打扫卫生呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.95,0:03:14.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家长了不得 孩子说的话就是不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.85,0:03:19.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么卫生 还不快去找找谁是你爸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.95,0:03:22.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦差点忘了 找也找不到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.45,0:03:27.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妈是出去卖的人 谁知道生你这次是卖给谁了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.35,0:03:29.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可怜可怜她 别继续说了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.75,0:03:32.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妈妈才不是那种人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.15,0:03:35.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来不是啊 不是就好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.55,0:03:43.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要尽我的义务就可以
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.35,0:03:48.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直努力做好该做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.85,0:03:53.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我仍然觉得 这还是因为我在顾虑妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.95,0:04:16.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妈是不是应该站街上才对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.45,0:04:24.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妈搭我一起卖 来买吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.95,0:04:39.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直认为 要好好听话 当个有用的人 不做让人讨厌的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.95,0:04:47.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是哪里不对呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.85,0:05:11.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.15,0:05:14.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了害怕没别的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.35,0:05:23.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太一所保护的东西 我也必须去保护
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.75,0:05:27.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不只是他 这是大家一起保护下来的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.15,0:05:31.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么想下去都要疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:34.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶紧找点事干 我能干些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.05,0:05:36.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都能干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.35,0:05:41.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.35,0:06:01.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是有点太花哨了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.95,0:06:03.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩子 在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.65,0:06:06.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.45,0:06:07.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.55,0:06:09.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.05,0:06:10.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.05,0:06:12.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我今晚不在家吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.35,0:06:15.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.25,0:06:17.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.75,0:06:19.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.25,0:06:20.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.45,0:06:22.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,文化节的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.95,0:06:27.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛 我还以为又是找你做裁缝活儿的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.55,0:06:34.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没时间做的话推掉不就得了 没必要为挣钱委屈自己
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.55,0:06:38.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然你的活儿非得越来越多不可
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.55,0:06:41.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我喜欢缝纫 没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.55,0:06:46.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好吃晚饭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.05,0:06:47.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.45,0:06:50.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保证营养一定能更变漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.15,0:06:51.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.15,0:06:55.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可是我骄傲的女儿 当然会漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.05,0:06:58.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我走啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.75,0:06:59.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路上小心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.75,0:07:11.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还差三件
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.85,0:07:16.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没钱了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.25,0:07:19.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美子 在家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.85,0:07:21.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请进
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.45,0:07:26.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.75,0:07:27.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经出门了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.15,0:07:30.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗 赶了个前后脚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.85,0:07:32.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谈工作?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.45,0:07:34.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是 带回来的吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.35,0:07:35.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在做衣服?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.65,0:07:37.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.15,0:07:41.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真厉害 这么董事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.25,0:07:43.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,渡边叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.95,0:07:51.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没直接问过你 我妈妈以前真的做过那种事么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.35,0:07:53.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这么传的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.95,0:08:01.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.55,0:08:11.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是她年轻的时候 因为你妈那时候太漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.75,0:08:15.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然 现在也漂亮 更漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.95,0:08:19.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃不吃苹果 很甜的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.75,0:08:23.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,渡边叔叔 我有件事拜托您
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.45,0:08:24.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.05,0:08:29.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我联系客人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.35,0:09:42.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等了很久吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.75,0:09:52.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以坐下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.15,0:09:54.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请坐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.75,0:10:02.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是半井摩子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.05,0:10:05.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,初次见面 我叫多多良惣二
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.05,0:10:09.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是半井 请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.85,0:10:11.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃点什么吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.05,0:10:12.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.15,0:10:32.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把车开来 你等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.65,0:10:33.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.45,0:10:42.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半井
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.65,0:10:50.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想干涉你们的生活 但你能告诉我这是怎么回事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.85,0:10:52.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.05,0:10:52.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.65,0:10:57.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会离开这个城市 能请您别再跟着我了好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.55,0:11:00.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.15,0:11:03.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有事就打我手机
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.75,0:11:16.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,合你口味么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.05,0:11:18.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.55,0:11:19.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.05,0:11:22.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能问一件事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.85,0:11:23.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:26.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么那么想要钱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.05,0:11:29.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不想说的话没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.65,0:11:32.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了证明自己
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.45,0:11:40.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样 那我给你钱如何 不用你付出代价
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.25,0:11:41.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.45,0:11:43.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概是…为了证明自己吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.45,0:11:50.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您的好意我心领了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.35,0:11:54.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果您这么做 我会无法原谅自己
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.45,0:11:58.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么笑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.15,0:12:02.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 只是觉得你真像你妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.85,0:12:09.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十多年前 你妈妈也这么跟我说过
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.55,0:12:11.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您认识我妈妈?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.45,0:12:15.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有你之前就认识了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.65,0:12:20.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际上 我曾向你妈妈求过婚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.05,0:12:24.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是被拒绝了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.25,0:12:25.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.25,0:12:27.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概是我没有魅力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.95,0:12:29.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有那种事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.35,0:12:37.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和美子相遇的时候 我刚进了一家制药公司
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.25,0:12:43.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在等候室看见了一位非常美丽的女士 就过去搭话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.45,0:12:49.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没多久 我就爱上了她
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.15,0:12:57.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来照顾你和孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.75,0:13:01.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您的好意我心领了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.75,0:13:05.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想靠自己的力量抚养这孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.85,0:13:07.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然的话 我会无法原谅自己
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.65,0:13:12.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美子选择了一条充满艰辛的路
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.35,0:13:17.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从怀上你之后 她也不再继续那种事了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.05,0:13:23.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然也求我帮过忙 但她一定不想依靠男人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.95,0:13:27.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.75,0:13:30.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.95,0:13:36.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩子!?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.45,0:13:38.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈!?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.75,0:13:41.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么来这了?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:43.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这工作?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.75,0:13:46.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 好久不见
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.15,0:13:48.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.25,0:13:49.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.05,0:13:51.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 只是偶然碰到而已
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.65,0:13:54.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把她看成你了 就跟她搭话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.35,0:13:56.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太假了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.85,0:13:59.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 摩子 你来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.75,0:14:01.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老板 怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.85,0:14:06.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,年轻人的事 你就少管点啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.95,0:14:10.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种事 当妈的应该负首要责任
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.85,0:14:13.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩子 到底怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.25,0:14:14.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.35,0:14:18.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可没碰她
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.75,0:14:23.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好不容易来一趟 先来喝杯果汁再走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.55,0:14:27.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是美子的女儿 来杯特制混合果汁
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.45,0:14:30.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我也不客气了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.95,0:14:36.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女儿? 她就是美子的女儿?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.65,0:14:39.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太可爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.95,0:14:41.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是 太可爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.15,0:14:43.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 到我们这坐坐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.65,0:14:44.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.05,0:14:45.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.05,0:14:50.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩子 你怎么能来这种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.55,0:14:53.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么叫“这种地方”
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.45,0:14:57.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是 我们可几乎每天晚上都来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.65,0:15:00.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老板 这可是你管理不力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.65,0:15:03.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 您说得没错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.45,0:15:05.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美子 快去倒酒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.35,0:15:13.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是有其母必有其女 太漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.55,0:15:15.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你 快给我住手
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.25,0:15:17.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是碰一下下啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.85,0:15:24.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要是敢碰我宝贝女儿 那可就不只是钱的问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.15,0:15:31.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美子 太过分了 竟然以为我是那种人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.25,0:15:36.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把人弄哭了 怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.05,0:15:39.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了 对不起 不哭不哭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.45,0:15:43.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么可能动她
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.85,0:15:50.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想当孩子他爸! 想照顾你俩一辈子!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.45,0:15:54.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别说你忘了 我可是认真跟你求婚的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.75,0:15:56.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么突然想起这个了…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.55,0:15:59.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么? 你竟然喜欢美子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.25,0:16:03.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不止是我啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.65,0:16:04.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.05,0:16:12.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去年我向她求婚的时候 她说想靠自己的力量扶养孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.55,0:16:14.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这么被甩了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.85,0:16:16.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.25,0:16:20.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛 我可也跟她求过婚的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.35,0:16:21.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们全都是?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.85,0:16:24.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…还有我…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.55,0:16:26.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美子姐姐太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.65,0:16:27.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家 这真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.55,0:16:29.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.35,0:16:36.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们可真丢人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.45,0:16:38.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 你明白了吗 摩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.15,0:16:42.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这的人都喜欢美子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.85,0:16:46.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈是个了不起的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.55,0:16:52.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这回轮到她哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.65,0:16:54.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩子 怎么哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.05,0:16:57.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天你怎么这么怪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.95,0:17:00.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都怪老板多嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.25,0:17:03.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思不好意思 我又不是故意的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.65,0:17:07.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,工作和店里都很重要 但是都没有我的摩子重要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.85,0:17:09.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是就是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.65,0:17:13.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就为美子和摩子的未来 干杯!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.55,0:17:14.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有这家店!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.85,0:17:16.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有大家!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.75,0:17:18.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干杯!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.25,0:17:19.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干杯!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.25,0:17:46.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧给你瘦的 为了制造美好回忆连觉都不睡了么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.85,0:17:52.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这难道是…COSPLAY!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.85,0:17:55.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么COSPLAY 那是制服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.45,0:18:00.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,业余水平 做得不好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.15,0:18:02.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看这料子 真好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.35,0:18:06.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间不够 只做了4套
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.95,0:18:08.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是闲着没事就做了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.25,0:18:09.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.35,0:18:11.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好 大家一起穿上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.95,0:18:15.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺合适嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.45,0:18:17.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.45,0:18:21.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来以为你是个挺闷的人 原来也不是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.75,0:18:26.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事 我们就放心了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.15,0:18:29.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.95,0:18:37.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忘掉所谓义务 让我们为自己去战斗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.15,0:18:55.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是哪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.95,0:19:00.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太怪了 以前都是在自己家所在的城市出现的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.85,0:19:02.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肥虫 这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.25,0:19:05.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是一种可能性
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.25,0:19:07.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,军队的直升机也没来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.15,0:19:12.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 没有平民的话就能放开手脚打了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.95,0:19:14.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反而对我们有利
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.25,0:19:44.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不会一直挨你的打
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.55,0:19:52.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手臂太长了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.35,0:19:54.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不适合近距离格斗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.15,0:19:56.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.05,0:20:06.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没必要总勉强自己做典范
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.35,0:20:28.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果自己负得起责任
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.35,0:20:34.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么去随心所欲就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.75,0:20:47.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈 谢谢您!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.15,0:21:02.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来电 公共电话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.45,0:21:05.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.85,0:21:08.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…我是宇白可奈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.05,0:21:09.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问是田中姐姐吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.85,0:21:10.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可奈?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.15,0:21:12.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在方便讲话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.55,0:21:14.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.65,0:21:16.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.85,0:21:19.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个 我想求您件事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.55,0:21:20.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.65,0:21:27.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请…请帮我找哥哥的亲生母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.75,0:23:08.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果要评出世上罪孽最深的人的话 结果一定是我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.85,0:23:13.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了他们两个 我很高兴献出自己的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.45,0:23:17.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下集 生命
